    "Compassion and purpose reinforce each other, giving the work an unusually generous motive. The complexity is between fluidity and form. Neptune prefers to drift and follow inspiration, while the 22 needs steady progress and clear boundaries, so a Life Path 22 Pisces may swing between grand visions and periods of doubt about whether any of it is possible. That oscillation keeps the work soulful, as long as the structure holds. It can help to partner with grounded, organised people who enjoy turning dreams into spreadsheets. Consider breaking large ideals into small, concrete deliverables with visible deadlines, and protecting time for solitude and creative replenishment, since a mutable water sign can be drained by the demands of large undertakings.",
